  {
    "claim_id": "ERC-imaging-net-4d031011",
    "text": "The library can detect and probe PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP, ICO, TIFF, PSD, EMF, WMF, and DICOM image files.",
    "kind": "format",
    "page_role": "product",
    "confidence": 0.93,
    "claim_source": "llm_enriched",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_file": "README.md",
        "snippet": "| Format | Detect | Width / Height | Bit depth | Frame count |\n|--------|:------:|:---------------:|:---------:|:-----------:|\n| PNG    | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| JPEG   | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | — |\n| GIF    | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n| BMP    | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | — |\n| WebP (lossy / lossless / extended) | ✅ | ✅ | — | — |\n| ICO    | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| TIFF   | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| PSD    | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | — |\n| EMF    | ✅ | ✅ (from bounds) | — | — |\n| WMF (placeable) | ✅ | ✅ (assumes 96 DPI) | — | — |\n| DICOM  | ✅ | ✅ (Rows/Columns) | ✅ (BitsAllocated) | — |"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": "enriched"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "ERC-imaging-net-f85fe27e",
    "text": "`ImageProbe.Probe` never throws on malformed or truncated input; it returns an `ImageInfo` containing only the `Format` when the header cannot be fully parsed.",
    "kind": "troubleshoot",
    "page_role": "kb",
    "confidence": 0.96,
    "claim_source": "llm_enriched",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_file": "README.md",
        "snippet": "`Probe` never throws on malformed or truncated input — if a file matches a format's signature but its header can't be fully parsed, you get back an `ImageInfo` with just the `Format` set rather than an exception."
      },
      {
        "source_file": "tests/Aspose.Imaging.Foss.Tests/ImageProbeTests.cs",
        "snippet": "var info = ImageProbe.Probe(SampleImages.TruncatedJpeg());\nAssert.Equal(ImageFormat.Jpeg, info.Format);\nAssert.Null(info.Width);\nAssert.Null(info.Height);"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": "enriched"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "ERC-imaging-net-fa3ebbfa",
    "text": "`ImageInfo` exposes nullable `Width`, `Height`, `BitDepth`, and `FrameCount` properties that are populated only when the format supports those values.",
    "kind": "api",
    "page_role": "reference",
    "confidence": 0.94,
    "claim_source": "llm_enriched",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_file": "Class: ImageInfo",
